*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_compute_using_two_qualified
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SALARY-TABLE.
   05 BASE-PAY PIC 9(6) VALUE 50000.
01 BONUS-TABLE.
   05 BASE-PAY PIC 9(6) VALUE 10000.
01 TOTAL-COMP PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE TOTAL-COMP = BASE-PAY OF SALARY-TABLE + BASE-PAY OF BONUS-TABLE.
    DISPLAY TOTAL-COMP.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING TOTAL-COMP DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0060000"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0060000] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

